    <summary>CLI to install AI skills from a hosted catalog</summary>
    <description>
STH (Skills Transfer Hub) is a single-binary Go CLI that connects a project to a hosted repository of AI resources, reads a SKILLS.md catalog, installs resources locally, and keeps them up to date.

Visible commands:
- `sth` opens the guided menu
- `sth init` configures a hosted repository for the current project
- `sth list` lists installable resources
- `sth install &lt;resource-ref&gt;` installs a resource
- `sth update` refreshes tracked resources
- `sth update self` self-updates the CLI from GitHub Releases
    </description>
